Like the [[Indestructible Golem]], the [[Malfunctioning Enduring Golem]] does not take damage from most sources because of [[Temporal Sheen]]. Picking up the [[Flux Matrix]] lying nearby on the ground, charging it at the [[Unstable Magical Energy Storage]], and dropping it nearby the golem deals significant (1337) damage to it.

